WEBVTT

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:04.033
Copilot is a family of AI experiences,

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:05.900
not one interchangeable tool.

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:08.800
Copilot Chat helps people research and draft.

00:00:08.933 --> 00:00:12.267
Microsoft 365 Copilot brings assistance

00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:15.333
into work apps and, with the right access,

00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:16.933
organizational information.

00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:18.933
GitHub Copilot supports coding.

00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:21.533
Copilot Studio helps teams build agents

00:00:21.533 --> 00:00:24.033
connected to their own knowledge and tools.

00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:25.333
Choose by the job,

00:00:25.333 --> 00:00:27.467
then check permissions, licensing,

00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:28.367
and the output.
